# Folder Structure & Code Organization

## 📁 Struktur Folder Utama

```
src/
├── components/          # Shared/Reusable Components
│   ├── layout/         # Layout Components
│   ├── moleculs/       # Molecule Components
│   └── page/           # Page-specific Components
├── features/           # Feature-based Modules
├── hooks/              # Custom React Hooks
├── libs/               # Library Configurations
├── routes/             # Routing Configuration
├── store/              # State Management
├── styles/             # Global Styles & Theme
├── types/              # TypeScript Definitions
├── utils/              # Utility Functions
├── enum/               # Enumeration & Constants
└── assets/             # Static Assets
```

## 🎯 Prinsip Organisasi Kode

### 1. Feature-Based Architecture

- Setiap fitur memiliki folder sendiri di `features/`
- Struktur konsisten untuk setiap fitur
- Separation of concerns yang jelas
- Modular dan scalable

### 2. Component Hierarchy

```
components/
├── layout/             # Layout-level components
│   ├── dashboard-layout.tsx
│   ├── guest-layout.tsx
│   ├── protected-layout.tsx
│   ├── Provider.tsx
│   ├── Sidebar.tsx
│   └── Topbar.tsx
├── moleculs/           # Reusable molecule components
│   ├── button/
│   ├── modal/
│   └── PaginationTotal.tsx
└── page/               # Page-specific components
    ├── page-not-found.tsx
    └── page-not-resource.tsx
```

### 3. Feature Structure Pattern

```
features/
├── [feature-name]/
│   ├── components/     # Feature-specific components
│   ├── hooks/          # Feature-specific hooks
│   ├── types.ts        # Feature type definitions
│   ├── page-[feature].tsx  # Main feature page
│   └── [id]/           # Dynamic routes (if applicable)
│       └── page-[feature]-detail.tsx
```

## 📂 Detail Struktur Folder

### `/components`

- **layout/**: Dashboard, Guest, Protected layouts, Sidebar, Topbar
- **moleculs/**: Button, Modal, Pagination, Form components
- **page/**: 404, Not Found, Error pages

### `/features`

- **activity-log/**: Logging dan history management
- **analytic/**: Dashboard dan analytics
- **authentication/**: Login, register, password management
- **history-stock-opname/**: Historical stock opname data
- **management-inventory/**: Inventory management system
- **master-data/**: Master data CRUD operations
  - **user/**: User management
  - **role/**: Role management
  - **employee/**: Employee management
  - **supplier/**: Supplier management
  - **working-location/**: Working location management
  - **rack/**: Rack management
  - **stock/**: Stock management
- **purchasing/**: Purchase order dan receipt system
- **stock-opname/**: Stock opname operations
  - **dashboard/**: Stock opname dashboard
  - **delegation-rack/**: Rack delegation
  - **different-location/**: Location differences
  - **different-quantity/**: Quantity differences
  - **log/**: Stock opname logs
  - **result-log/**: Result logs
  - **shrinkage/**: Shrinkage calculations
  - **report-location/**: Location reports

### `/hooks`

- **useDebounceCallback.tsx**: Debounced callback hook
- Custom React hooks untuk logic reuse
- Business logic separation
- State management helpers

### `/libs`

- **axios.ts**: HTTP client configuration (ERP & Auth instances)
- **dayjs.ts**: Date handling setup
